# =============================================================================
# NATIVE PATLANG LEXER - LEXICAL PATTERN DEFINITIONS
# Phase 1: Foundation Components
# =============================================================================

# Character classification facts and pattern rules for basic token recognition
# Uses PaTLang's reasoning system for flexible pattern matching

# Enable reasoning mode for pattern matching
reasoning mode on

# =============================================================================
# CHARACTER CLASSIFICATION FACTS
# =============================================================================

